Cameras =E2=80=93 automated license plate readers, to be specific =E2=80=93=
 made by Flock Safety are inspiring ire and violence across the country. Th=
ese cameras snap pictures of car=E2=80=99s license plates as they drive by.=
 According to Flock, about 120,000 cameras erected across the US conduct 2b=
