Like datacenters, the cameras offer a physical object to resist, unlike a s=
ocial network or a piece of software. It=E2=80=99s quite a lot easier to pr=
otest a gigantic ugly building or an ominous black camera on the side of th=
e road than it is to give up Instagram.

Widespread video surveillance in the US isn=E2=80=99t entirely new. In the =
aftermath of the terror attacks of 11 September 2001, the US government vas=
